{"2799820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FSA DRIVING", "steam_appid": 2799820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <strong>FSA DRIVING</strong>! In Nijnait City—inspired by the urban landscape of Tianjin—put your exceptional driving skills to the test. Explore every street, discover the fastest routes, and race against time to deliver for your clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich and Engaging Open World</strong><br>Roam through Nijnait City, modeled after Tianjin, from its vibrant downtown to the vast open wilderness on the outskirts. Collect hidden items and dive into a variety of built-in mini-games and interactive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Stunt Abilities</strong><br>Go beyond standard driving with eye-popping maneuvers like blade-style overtakes and aerial glides—moves that would be impossible in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Simulation Elements</strong><br>Trade specialty goods at shops across the city. Buy low, sell high, and outpace the ever-changing market prices.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of <strong>FSA DRIVING</strong>! In Nijnait City—inspired by the urban landscape of Tianjin—put your exceptional driving skills to the test. Explore every street, discover the fastest routes, and race against time to deliver for your clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich and Engaging Open World</strong><br>Roam through Nijnait City, modeled after Tianjin, from its vibrant downtown to the vast open wilderness on the outskirts. Collect hidden items and dive into a variety of built-in mini-games and interactive experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Stunt Abilities</strong><br>Go beyond standard driving with eye-popping maneuvers like blade-style overtakes and aerial glides—moves that wo